    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in Tamixa School in this horror adventure. Explore the school without attracting the attention of the mysterious creatures until they leave the area. Use the school cameras, your flaslight and your stealth skills to avoid getting caught before it's too late...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Welcome to CEIP Tamixa!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the afternoons and evenings at this public school, Zamorano, a high school teacher, sees shadows that haunt him as he walks around the school. You will have to find out why Zamorano is being haunted and what he is doing there at Tamixa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/d35a7a21697a0153bb0ec5c13cee3dfd.poster.avif?t=1754775273\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/d35a7a21697a0153bb0ec5c13cee3dfd.webm?t=1754775273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/d35a7a21697a0153bb0ec5c13cee3dfd.mp4?t=1754775273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0The Cameras</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The public school contains security cameras managed from the library computer. Access the images to find out where every shadow is lurking before you go outside the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/dd55ad55d208bf100cc478933c486300.poster.avif?t=1754775273\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/dd55ad55d208bf100cc478933c486300.webm?t=1754775273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/dd55ad55d208bf100cc478933c486300.mp4?t=1754775273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your tasks to avoid going crazy, avoiding the shadows lurking around the school to achieve your true mission and the reason you are at Tamixa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/9cc9b4c12e02191268367f5dfbc1bcb0.poster.avif?t=1754775273\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/9cc9b4c12e02191268367f5dfbc1bcb0.webm?t=1754775273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670210/extras/9cc9b4c12e02191268367f5dfbc1bcb0.mp4?t=1754775273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
